#X text 20 80 dictpack_stub: Max's dict.pack combines the 8 inlet values into a keyed dictionary object. Pd has no equivalent dictionary/dict type here -- this stub just packs them into a plain 8-element LIST (in the same order\, but without the key labels) via [pack]. Anything downstream expecting a real dict (key lookups etc.) will need reworking., f 560;
